<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Plans — ZenPak</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/brand/zenpak-z-app.svg" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/page-theme.css" />
    <script src="/js/theme-init.js"></script>
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            background: var(--p-bg);
            color: var(--p-text);
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .wrap {
            margin: 0 auto;
            max-width: 860px;
            padding: 48px 24px 80px;
        }
        header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--p-border);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .brand {
            color: var(--p-accent);
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .subtitle {
            color: var(--p-muted);
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 0 0 48px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .plans {
            display: grid;
            gap: 20px;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }
        .plan {
            background: var(--p-surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--p-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            padding: 28px 24px;
        }
        .plan.featured {
            border-color: var(--p-accent);
            border-width: 2px;
            padding: 27px 23px;
        }
        .plan-name {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 4px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .plan-price {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .plan-price-alt {
            color: var(--p-muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            min-height: 1.4em;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .plan-price span {
            color: var(--p-muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }
        .plan-desc {
            color: var(--p-muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            min-height: 44px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .plan ul {
            flex: 1;
            list-style: none;
            margin: 0 0 24px;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .plan li {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            padding-left: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .plan li::before {
            color: var(--p-accent);
            content: '✓';
            left: 0;
            position: absolute;
        }
        .btn {
            background: var(--p-accent);
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: var(--p-on-accent);
            display: block;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .btn:hover { background: var(--p-accent-hover); }
        .btn-ghost {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--p-border-control);
            color: var(--p-text);
        }
        .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--p-hover); }
        .legal-note {
            background: var(--p-note-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--p-border-soft);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: var(--p-muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
        }
        .legal-note strong { color: var(--p-strong); }
        .faq { margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .faq h2 {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
        }
        .faq dt {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0 0 4px;
        }
        .faq dd {
            color: var(--p-body-soft);
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
        }
        a { color: var(--p-accent); }
        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--p-border);
            color: var(--p-muted);
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            font-size: 13px;
            gap: 8px;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-top: 60px;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }
        footer a { color: var(--p-muted); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrap">
        <header>
            <a class="brand" href="/">ZenPak</a>
        </header>

        <h1>Plans</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">The core is free and open-source. Paid plans support the hosted service.</p>

        <div class="plans">
            <div class="plan">
                <div class="plan-name">Free</div>
                <div class="plan-price">€0 <span>/ month</span></div>
                <div class="plan-price-alt" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="plan-desc">The full app. No paywalled core features.</div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Unlimited gear lists</li>
                    <li>Reusable item library</li>
                    <li>Packing mode</li>
                    <li>Community discover</li>
                    <li>Public profile page — lists only, no avatar or bio</li>
                    <li>CSV import / export</li>
                    <li>Self-hosting supported</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/welcome" class="btn btn-ghost" data-umami-event="plan-click" data-umami-event-plan="free">Get started free</a>
            </div>

            <div class="plan featured">
                <div class="plan-name">Kin</div>
                <div class="plan-price">€19 <span>/ year</span></div>
                <div class="plan-price-alt" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="plan-desc">Support the project.</div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Everything in Free</li>
                    <li>Supporter badge on profile</li>
                    <li>Avatar, bio and travel name</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/welcome" class="btn" data-umami-event="plan-click" data-umami-event-plan="kin">Become Kin</a>
            </div>

            <div class="plan">
                <div class="plan-name">Wayfarer</div>
                <div class="plan-price">€5 <span>/ month</span></div>
                <div class="plan-price-alt">or €39 / year (save 35%)</div>
                <div class="plan-desc">For creators.</div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Everything in Kin</li>
                    <li>Affiliate links per item</li>
                    <li>Promo codes</li>
                    <li>Guide dashboard</li>
                    <li>View, copy &amp; click insights</li>
                    <li>Wayfarer badge</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/welcome" class="btn" data-umami-event="plan-click" data-umami-event-plan="wayfarer">Become Wayfarer</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-note">
            <strong>Billing note —</strong> Payments are processed by <a href="https://stripe.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stripe</a> for FX Bénard AE — ZenPak. Prices shown are final amounts payable; ZenPak does not present separate identical pre-tax and tax-included prices while the French VAT exemption applies. Subscriptions renew automatically and can be cancelled from the customer portal. Access continues until the end of the billing period. By subscribing, you expressly request immediate performance of the digital service and acknowledge the withdrawal terms in the Terms of Service. <strong>TVA non applicable, art. 293 B du CGI</strong> — FX Bénard, auto-entrepreneur, SIRET 75082412000026.
        </div>

        <div class="faq">
            <h2>Questions</h2>
            <dl>
                <dt>Is self-hosting fully featured?</dt>
                <dd>Yes. The open-source repo is billing-agnostic — all core features work without a Stripe account. Paid plans (Kin, Wayfarer) only apply to the hosted service at zenpak.app. See the <a href="https://github.com/zenpakapp/zenpak#self-hosting" target="_blank" rel="noopener">self-hosting guide</a> to get started.</dd>

                <dt>Can I migrate from lighterpack.com?</dt>
                <dd>Yes. Export your CSV from lighterpack.com and import it in ZenPak settings. Lists, items, weights, and categories carry over.</dd>

                <dt>What happens if I cancel?</dt>
                <dd>Your account reverts to the Free tier at the end of the billing period. Your data is never deleted.</dd>

                <dt>Do you offer refunds?</dt>
                <dd>Yes — 14-day full refund, no questions asked. Email <a href="mailto:support@zenpak.app">support@zenpak.app</a> within 14 days of a charge and we'll refund you immediately.</dd>
            </dl>
        </div>

        <footer>
            <span>© 2026 FX Bénard — ZenPak</span>
            <span>
                <a href="/about">About</a> ·
                <a href="https://github.com/zenpakapp/zenpak" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source</a> ·
                <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a> ·
                <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> ·
                <a href="/terms">Terms</a> ·
                <a href="/legal">Legal</a> ·
                <a href="mailto:support@zenpak.app">Contact</a>
            </span>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
